WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:03.810
SPEAKER: Data, it's being
created all the time

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:07.170
from devices, applications,
and their users.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.960
Because it's digital
it's measurable,

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.770
but what about information
offline, in the physical world?

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:17.250
There's actionable offline data
just waiting to be discovered.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.290
And with devices that
can capture, convert,

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.210
and send the newly
discovered data,

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.190
businesses in any
industry can start

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.440
measuring their
operations in real time

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.560
to anticipate events
proactively and to spot issues

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.260
before they become problems.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.200
Processing this data would
be easy for a few devices,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.260
but what about hundreds,
thousands, or even millions?

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.650
Google Cloud Platform
offers powerful tools

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.560
to capture massive volumes
of data distributed around

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.400
the world along with an easy
way to process the data,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.945
whether it's
streaming in real time

00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:49.910
or tucked away in your logs.

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.690
Query instantly into
what's happening

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.870
in any part of your business
with easy to use big data

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.870
tools and zero
infrastructure management.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.720
So no matter what
your business is,

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:03.270
you can analyze performance
in all the places that matter.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:05.519
This is the Internet of Things.

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:08.190
Get started today and see
how Google Cloud Platform

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.900
can extend your businesses
into a connected world.

